@startuml 05-sequence-ai-advisor
title AI Usage Advisor
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #4F46E5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C7D2FE
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF2FF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #4F46E5
skinparam ParticipantFontStyle bold
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #EEF2FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4F46E5
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #EEF2FF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #4F46E5
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F59E0B
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam SequenceGroupHeaderFontColor #334155
skinparam SequenceDividerBackgroundColor #E0E7FF
skinparam SequenceDividerBorderColor #4F46E5
skinparam TitleFontSize 18

actor User
participant "Web app" as Web
participant "API" as API
database "Database" as DB
participant "AI model" as AI

User -> Web : ask a question
Web -> API : POST /ai/advisor
API -> DB : read usage numbers\n(only what this user may see)
API -> AI : question + numbers
AI --> API : summary and advice (JSON)
API --> Web : answer
Web --> User : show the answer

note over API, AI
  The AI only explains the numbers.
  It cannot read or change the database.
end note
@enduml
